---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Pokoly.com"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection transparency for Pokoly.com free browser games."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-black text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">Effective Date: January 1, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        At Pokoly (accessible at pokoly.com), we prioritize visitor privacy. All our games execute client-side in your web browser. We do not require account registration, passwords, or personal identity verification.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Pokoly utilizes standard browser `localStorage` solely to save your in-game high scores, word streaks, and audio mute preferences directly on your device. This data never leaves your computer or phone and is not transmitted to external servers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Third-Party Advertising & Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with programmatic ad networks (such as Google AdSense, AdinPlay, or similar monetization partners) to display contextual advertisements. These partners may use cookies, web beacons, or unique identifiers to serve non-intrusive ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ad Settings or aboutads.info.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <span class="text-brand-neon font-mono">privacy@pokoly.com</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
